<section class="bds-blueprint-section bds-card-grid" aria-labelledby="two-col-title" data-blueprint-key="card_grid"><div class="bds-blueprint-section__container"><header class="bds-card-grid__header"><p class="bds-card-grid__subtitle">Eyebrow</p><h2 id="two-col-title" class="bds-card-grid__title">A clear, compelling headline</h2><p class="bds-card-grid__description">Supporting copy that sets the type rhythm.</p></header><ul class="bds-grid bds-grid--cols-2 bds-grid--gap-xl" style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0" role="list"><li><div class="bds-stack bds-stack--orientation-vertical bds-stack--gap-sm"><h3 class="bds-card-grid__item-title">With image</h3><p class="bds-card-grid__item-description">Has an image, a category and options.</p></div></li><li><div class="bds-stack bds-stack--orientation-vertical bds-stack--gap-sm"><h3 class="bds-card-grid__item-title">Category only</h3><p class="bds-card-grid__item-description">No image, so the ServiceTag icon fills the media frame.</p></div></li><li><div class="bds-stack bds-stack--orientation-vertical bds-stack--gap-sm"><h3 class="bds-card-grid__item-title">Bare</h3><p class="bds-card-grid__item-description"></p></div></li></ul></div></section>